7776,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/pubs.aip.org\/jap\/article\/112\/3\/034301\/915663\/Crystalline-structure-of-GeTe-layer-in-GeTe-Sb2Te3"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[2012,8,1]]},"references-count":14,"journal-issue":{"issue":"3","published-print":{"date-parts":[[2012,8,1]]}},"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1063\/1.4739741","ISSN":["0021-8979","1089-7550"],"issn-type":[{"type":"print","value":"0021-8979"},{"type":"electronic","value":"1089-7550"}],"published-other":{"date-parts":[[2012,8,1]]},"published":{"date-parts":[[2012,8,1]]},"article-number":"034301"},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,2,26]],"date-time":"2026-02-26T17:18:33Z","timestamp":1772126313643,"version":"3.50.1"},"description":"Supplemental Information for 10.1021\/acs.chemmater.9b02533","reference-count":0,"publisher":"American Chemical Society (ACS)","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"DOI":"10.1021\/acs.chemmater.9b02533.s001","type":"component","created":{"date-parts":[[2020,4,7]],"date-time":"2020-04-07T20:55:02Z","timestamp":1586292902000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Atomic Layer Deposition of Nanocrystalline-As-Deposited (GeTe)x(Sb2Te3)1x Films for Endurable Phase Change Memory"],"prefix":"10.1021","member":"316","deposited":{"date-parts":[[2020,4,7]],"date-time":"2020-04-07T20:55:03Z","timestamp":1586292903000},"score":41.06977,"resource":{"primary":{"URL":"https:\/\/pubs.acs.org\/doi\/suppl\/10.1021\/acs.chemmater.9b02533\/suppl_file\/cm9b02533_si_001.pdf"}},"issued":{"date-parts":[[null]]},"references-count":0,"URL":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1021\/acs.chemmater.9b02533.s001","relation":{"is-component-of":[{"id-type":"doi","id":"10.1021\/acs.chemmater.9b02533","asserted-by":"object"}]}},{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,9,17]],"date-time":"2026-09-17T10:46:15Z","timestamp":1789641975008,"version":"4.0.0"},"reference-count":23,"publisher":"AIP Publishing","issue":"2","content-domain":{"domain":["pubs.aip.org"],"crossmark-restriction":true},"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2016,7,11]]},"abstract":"<jats:p>Nonvolatile memory devices or circuits that can implement both storage and calculation are a crucial requirement for the efficiency improvement of modern computer. In this work, we realize logic functions by using [GeTe\/Sb2Te3]n super lattice phase change memory (PCM) cell in which higher threshold voltage is needed for phase change with a magnetic field applied. First, the [GeTe\/Sb2Te3]n super lattice cells were fabricated and the R-V curve was measured. Then we designed the logic circuits with the super lattice PCM cell verified by HSPICE simulation and experiments. Seven basic logic functions are first demonstrated in this letter; then several multi-input logic gates are presented. The proposed logic devices offer the advantages of simple structures and low power consumption, indicating that the super lattice PCM has the potential in the future nonvolatile central processing unit design, facilitating the development of massive parallel computing architecture.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1063\/1.4958708","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2016,7,12]],"date-time":"2016-07-12T19:05:41Z","timestamp":1468350341000},"update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1063\/aip-crossmark-policy-page","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":14,"title":["Logic gates realized by nonvolatile GeTe\/Sb2Te3 super lattice phase-change memory with a magnetic field input"],"prefix":"10.1063","volume":"109","author":[{"given":"Bin","family":"Lu","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Huazhong University of Science and Technology 1 School of Optical and Electronic Information, , Wuhan 430074, China"},{"name":"Huazhong University of Science and Technology 2 Wuhan National Laboratory for Optoelectronics, , Wuhan 430074, China"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-6366-7801","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Xiaomin","family":"Cheng","sequence":"additi